1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:06,908
The Federal Trade Commission alleged Texans faced tens of millions in extra anesthesia costs each year.

2
00:00:07,358 --> 00:00:16,200
It linked those costs to a consolidation strategy by U.S. Anesthesia Partners, created by private equity firm Welsh Carson.

3
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:23,658
The complaint says patients rarely choose their anesthesia provider, and members help fund coverage through premiums.

4
00:00:24,108 --> 00:00:28,033
U.S. Anesthesia Partners denied the allegations.
